# public-hygiene: machine-local private patterns and settings (never commit).
# `*.local` above does NOT match `settings.local.json`, and CLAUDE.md actively tells sessions to
# put local-only values (credentials, MCP tokens, private paths) in these files.
.hygiene.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json

